        "loc_qi_sea_grotto_heaven",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "res_life_qi",
        "res_death_qi",
        "res_blade_qi",
        "res_dusk_qi",
        "res_dawn_qi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Unlimited qi sea grows stronger by gathering many kinds of qi. After Qi Xiang created the move, he collected all sorts of qi into the immortal aperture, including sword qi among life qi, death qi, blade qi, dusk qi, dawn qi, and others. Unused stored qi dissipates over time.",
      "chapters": [
        1934
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unlimited-qi-sea-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_xiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s modified unlimited qi sea can expend qi path immortal materials to raise its power. It can use all kinds of qi in the world, including sword qi among life qi, death qi, blade qi, dusk qi, and dawn qi; the more qi path immortal materials stored in it, the stronger the move.",
      "chapters": [
        2052
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
